{"id":"1e1ca272fd03f2d5","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-long-code.md","title":"以坐标函数编码的长码","display":"df-long-code — 以坐标函数编码的长码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-long-code","aliases":["28-df-long-code"],"display":"df-long-code — 以坐标函数编码的长码","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 22.23","source_printed_pages":"480","source_pdf_pages":"506","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-long-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-long-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-long-code — 以坐标函数编码的长码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 22.23"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"480"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"506"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in[W]\">\\(w\\in[W]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}\">\\(\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}\\)</span> 为所有 W 位符号向量。码字坐标以该集合中的 x 编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LC}_W:[W]\\to\\{-1,1\\}^{\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}},\\qquad\\operatorname{LC}_W(w)(x)\\coloneqq x_w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LC}_W:[W]\\to\\{-1,1\\}^{\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}},\\qquad\\operatorname{LC}_W(w)(x)\\coloneqq x_w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v\\in[W]\\quad u\\ne v\\Longrightarrow 2^{-W}|\\{x:\\operatorname{LC}_W(u)(x)\\ne\\operatorname{LC}_W(v)(x)\\}|=\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v\\in[W]\\quad u\\ne v\\Longrightarrow 2^{-W}|\\{x:\\operatorname{LC}_W(u)(x)\\ne\\operatorname{LC}_W(v)(x)\\}|=\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>消息只有 log₂W 位，码字有 2^W 个坐标；码字就是原书坐标函数 χ_{ {w} }。u≠v 时两坐标是独立公平符号，恰半数 x 上不同。W=1 时只有一个消息，差异断言真空成立。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 22.23；印刷页 480；PDF 页 506。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in[W]","display":false},{"tex":"\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LC}_W:[W]\\to\\{-1,1\\}^{\\{-1,1\\}^{[W]}},\\qquad\\operatorname{LC}_W(w)(x)\\coloneqq x_w.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u,v\\in[W]\\quad u\\ne v\\Longrightarrow 2^{-W}|\\{x:\\operatorname{LC}_W(u)(x)\\ne\\operatorname{LC}_W(v)(x)\\}|=\\frac12.","display":true}],"bytes":1280,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-402","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}